    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803170/extras/7c6363ccca0f56fcb68cc870cc5c39ad.avif?t=1754675891\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803170/extras/e2c75eaf720c754e23b351097ed455b7.poster.avif?t=1754675891\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803170/extras/e2c75eaf720c754e23b351097ed455b7.webm?t=1754675891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Choose your brave character and explore a planet with space landscapes ranging from alien forests to arid deserts, facing unknown creatures. Collect valuable resources and build your own tools, which may be the key to survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803170/extras/c31c45c0fd5b4341f31ae46333d7ca27.poster.avif?t=1754675891\" width=660 height=201 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803170/extras/c31c45c0fd5b4341f31ae46333d7ca27.webm?t=1754675891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Craft tools and repair the spacecraft using materials found on the planet. Defend yourself against hostile threats while struggling to rebuild your broken heart, both literally and figuratively.<br><br>Show that you can survive anywhere in the galaxy. In &quot;Kind Heart Survivors,&quot; your skills will be put to the test. Do you have what it takes to overcome the challenges and thrive in an unknown world? Venture forth and find out!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803170/extras/1cd19a6bc4982d1645f2af8dab894ca7.poster.avif?t=1754675891\" width=660 height=201 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803170/extras/1cd19a6bc4982d1645f2af8dab894ca7.webm?t=1754675891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><br>Exploration<br>Inventory management<br>Base building<br>Item crafting<br>Survival<br>Management of life, oxygen, and hunger<br>A survival game inspired by classics with an original twist!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803170/extras/7c6363ccca0f56fcb68cc870cc5c39ad.avif?t=1754675891\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803170/extras/e2c75eaf720c754e23b351097ed455b7.poster.avif?t=1754675891\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803170/extras/e2c75eaf720c754e23b351097ed455b7.webm?t=1754675891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Choose your brave character and explore a planet with space landscapes ranging from alien forests to arid deserts, facing unknown creatures. Collect valuable resources and build your own tools, which may be the key to survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803170/extras/c31c45c0fd5b4341f31ae46333d7ca27.poster.avif?t=1754675891\" width=660 height=201 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803170/extras/c31c45c0fd5b4341f31ae46333d7ca27.webm?t=1754675891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Craft tools and repair the spacecraft using materials found on the planet. Defend yourself against hostile threats while struggling to rebuild your broken heart, both literally and figuratively.<br><br>Show that you can survive anywhere in the galaxy. In &quot;Kind Heart Survivors,&quot; your skills will be put to the test. Do you have what it takes to overcome the challenges and thrive in an unknown world? Venture forth and find out!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803170/extras/1cd19a6bc4982d1645f2af8dab894ca7.poster.avif?t=1754675891\" width=660 height=201 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803170/extras/1cd19a6bc4982d1645f2af8dab894ca7.webm?t=1754675891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><br>Exploration<br>Inventory management<br>Base building<br>Item crafting<br>Survival<br>Management of life, oxygen, and hunger<br>A survival game inspired by classics with an original twist!",
